  "liner": {
   "body_md": "This recording captures Mountain Goats performing a twenty-song set on Tuesday, January 30, 2024, at 24 Oxford in Las Vegas, Nevada [1][2]. The audio, which runs for eighty-one minutes, was taped and transferred by Rachel [1]. It is the only available recording of this specific show, which is listed as the 408th of 467 archived performances for the band [2]. The setlist spans the band's extensive catalog, beginning with “Hair Match” from Beat the Champ and “Shirtless in Hamburg” from Marsh Witch Visions [1]. The performance includes tracks from albums such as In League with Dragons, Get Lonely, and The Coroner’s Gambit [1]. Notable selections include “Jenny III” from Jenny From Thebes and “Liza Forever Minnelli” from All Eternals Deck [1]. The set features “The Grey King and the Silver Flame Attunement” from Goths, as well as “Dance Music” and “Up the Wolves” from The Sunset Tree [1]. The band also performed “Heel Turn 2” and “Fresh Tattoo” [1]. The setlist concludes with “This Year” [1]. This show followed a previous archived performance at the El Rey Theater on January 28, 2024 [2]. The recording is recommended for listeners because it is the sole documented capture of this Las Vegas date, providing a complete view of the evening's musical journey [1][2].",
